  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Season chicken with salt and pepper, then cook in a pan with 1 tbsp of butter until browned.",
    "Add the fish sauce, coriander, cumin, and chili flakes to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Roll out the pie crust and place it in a pie dish.",
    "Fill the pie crust with the chicken mixture and top with mashed potatoes.",
    "Dot the top of the potatoes with the remaining 1 tbsp of butter.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes, or until the crust is golden brown and the potatoes are heated through.",
    "Garnish with chopped green onions and serve hot."
